"AutoFirma or another copy of rFirma — and try again from the page."

msgid "sede.refusals.unknown"
msgstr "{{origin}} sent something rFirma can't handle."

msgid "sede.refusals.saveCancelled"
msgstr ""
"You closed the save dialog without choosing where to save the file "
"{{origin}} asked for."

msgid "sede.refusals.loadCancelled"
msgstr "You closed the load dialog without choosing any file for {{origin}}."

msgid "sede.refusals.cannotSaveData"
msgstr "The file {{origin}} asked for couldn't be written where you chose."

msgid "sede.refusals.cannotLoadData"
msgstr "One of the files chosen for {{origin}} couldn't be read."

msgid "sede.refusals.batchPresignerUnreachable"
msgstr "The {{origin}} service that prepares the batch didn't answer."

msgid "sede.refusals.batchPostsignerUnreachable"
msgstr "The {{origin}} service that closes the batch didn't answer."

msgid "sede.refusals.batchInvalidPresignResponse"
msgstr ""
"The {{origin}} service that prepares the batch answered something rFirma "
"can't read."

msgid "sede.refusals.batchInvalidPostsignResponse"
msgstr ""
"The {{origin}} service that closes the batch answered something rFirma can't "
"read."

msgid "sede.refusals.batchSigningFailed"
msgstr "The batch signature {{origin}} asked for didn't complete."

msgid "sede.refusals.triphaseServerUrlMissing"
msgstr ""
"{{origin}} asked to sign with its signing service, but didn't say where it "
"is."

msgid "sede.refusals.triphaseServerException"
msgstr "The {{origin}} signing service returned an error."

msgid "sede.refusals.triphaseServerUnreachable"
msgstr "The {{origin}} signing service didn't answer."

msgid "sede.refusals.triphaseServerUnexpectedAnswer"
msgstr "The {{origin}} signing service answered something rFirma can't read."

msgid "sede.refusals.certificateNotFound"
msgstr ""
"The chosen certificate is no longer available, or {{origin}} doesn't accept "
"it."

msgid "sede.refusals.folderMissing"
msgstr "The folder rFirma had to write to for {{origin}} no longer exists."

msgid "sede.refusals.unwritable"
msgstr "rFirma couldn't write the file {{origin}} needed."

msgid "sede.refusals.invalidSignature"
msgstr "The document {{origin}} sent carries a signature that isn't valid."

msgid "sede.refusals.confirmationNeeded"
msgstr ""
"{{origin}} asked to sign without asking you, but the document needs you to "
"confirm something first."

msgid "sede.refusals.localBatchSign"
msgstr "The batch {{origin}} sent can't be signed as it is."

msgid "sede.refusals.siteErrandNotLive"
msgstr "The errand with {{origin}} had already ended when your answer arrived."

msgid "sede.refusals.pdfHasUnregisteredSignatures"
msgstr ""
"The PDF {{origin}} sent carries signatures that aren't recorded in its form, "
"and rFirma won't sign on top of them unless you confirm."

msgid "sede.refusals.secretOnTheReaderKeypad"
msgstr ""
"This certificate's PIN is typed on the card reader, and rFirma can't ask for "
"it that way yet."

msgid "sede.refusals.userCancelled"
msgstr ""
"You cancelled the PIN request, so the signature {{origin}} asked for wasn't "
"made."

msgid "sede.refusals.promptFailed"
msgstr ""
"rFirma couldn't ask you for the PIN for the signature {{origin}} asked for."

msgid "sede.refusals.explicitXades"
msgstr ""
"{{origin}} asked for an old kind of signature that is no longer safe: that "
"signature could pass for the signature of a different document from yours. "
"That's why rFirma doesn't make it. It's not your fault; if you need to "
"finish the errand, contact {{origin}}."

msgid "sede.refusals.invoiceMultisignature"
msgstr ""
"{{origin}} asked to add a signature to an electronic invoice that is already "
"signed. An electronic invoice only takes one signature, so rFirma can't do "
"it. It's not your fault; if you need to finish the errand, contact "
"{{origin}}."

msgid "sede.refusals.unsupportedCountersignature"
msgstr ""
"{{origin}} asked to sign over someone else's signature on a kind of document "
"that doesn't allow it, so rFirma can't do it. It's not your fault; if you "
"need to finish the errand, contact {{origin}}."

msgid "sede.siteNotes.explicitXades"
msgstr ""
"Remove mode=explicit or use explicit CAdES, which signs the document without "
"including it."

msgid "sede.siteNotes.invoiceMultisignature"
msgstr ""
"FacturaE doesn't support cosigning or countersigning; ask for a simple "
"signature (sign)."

msgid "sede.siteNotes.unsupportedCountersignature"
msgstr ""
"Countersigning only exists in CAdES, CMS and XAdES; in any other format, ask "
"for a cosignature (cosign)."

msgid "sede.noCertificate.noneTitle"
msgstr "You don't have any certificate"

msgid "sede.noCertificate.noneBody"
msgstr "You need one installed to sign at {{origin}}."

msgid "sede.noCertificate.noneBodyUnknownOrigin"
msgstr "You need one installed to sign."

msgid "sede.noCertificate.noneHint"
msgstr "Get one from the FNMT or from your regional government."

msgid "sede.noCertificate.install"
msgstr "Install a certificate…"

msgid "sede.noCertificate.lookAgain"
msgstr "Look again"

#. La sede excluyó todos los certificados de la persona. Se dice cuántos tiene
#. —estado de su almacén— y nunca cuáles descartó la sede ni por qué.
msgid "sede.noCertificate.excludedTitle"
msgid_plural "sede.noCertificate.excludedTitle"
msgstr[0] "{{origin}} does not accept your certificate"
msgstr[1] "{{origin}} accepts none of your {{count}} certificates"
msgstr[2] "{{origin}} accepts none of your {{count}} certificates"

msgid "sede.noCertificate.excludedBody"
msgstr "You'll have to carry on from the site."

